      <h2>What to expect.</h2>
      <p><strong>First call back:</strong> We scope the job. If it's simple (water heater swap, drain cleaning, fixture install) we quote a flat rate and book the truck. If it's complicated (repipe, remodel, code issue) we schedule a free 30-minute site visit.</p>
      <p><strong>The truck arrives:</strong> On time or earlier. Tech calls 30 minutes before arrival. Floors protected, tools organized, work area respected like it's our grandmother's house.</p>
      <p><strong>Work done, paid, done:</strong> Fixed-price quote, fixed-price invoice. No surprises, no "oh by the way." One-year warranty on labor.</p>

      <h3>If it's truly an emergency.</h3>
      <p>Don't wait for us to call back. Grab the phone and dial <a href="tel:8015550134">(801) 555-0134</a> — press 9 at the menu for emergency. We pay the on-call tech to keep their phone charged.</p>

      <h3>While you wait.</h3>
      <p>A few things to have ready for the call:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Where is the main water shut-off? (If you don't know, we'll help over the phone.)</li>
        <li>What's the approximate age of the home?</li>
        <li>If replacing an appliance: make and model if handy, but we'll figure it out if not.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

